WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.725
The record those steps share has a short
data contract, kept in the kit's read me.

2
00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:08.883
Every payload says what kind it
is, a finding or a closure signal,

3
00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:13.600
where it came from, and which of Book
3's seven drift classes it belongs to.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.754
It carries a severity, P1 to P4, the
system where the re-read will happen,

5
00:00:18.754 --> 00:00:23.637
one subject identifier, and the
intended state a re-read must find.

6
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:28.862
The workbook doesn't restate where each
field lands in Book 13's evidence record.

7
00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.700
It makes the fields checkable.
